                        <div class="interest-item">
                            <h3 class="interest-title">Earth Science</h3>
                            <p class="interest-desc">Exploring the wonders of Earth Science and Disaster Prevention / Mitigation.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="interest-item">
                            <h3 class="interest-title">Community</h3>
