                <h2 class="section-title">About DPMBG</h2>
                <div class="section-content">
                    <p class="section-text">
                        DPMBG, or Disaster Prevention and Mitigation Basic Group. Explore the beauty of Earth Science. Currently running on QQ China.
                    </p>
